/-
  Level-`N` regular differentials: holomorphy, vanishing at the cusps, and the injection
  into weight-two cusp forms for `Γ(N)`.

  Three headlines, at the pin's names and statements:

  * `ModularCurve.LevelN.exists_linearMap_regularDifferentials_mdifferentiable` — every
    regular differential on the function field `K` of `X(N)` is a sum of terms
    `(a/b) • D(c/e)` with `a, b, c, e ∈ ring N`, and there is an injective `ℂ`-linear map
    `Ψ` from `regularDifferentials ℂ K` to `ℍ → ℂ` whose image is holomorphic and which
    computes the differential on such a representation;
  * `ModularCurve.LevelN.isZeroAtImInfty_slash_of_mem_regularDifferentials` — the
    image function of a regular differential vanishes at `i∞` after any slash by
    `SL(2, ℤ)`;
  * `ModularCurve.LevelN.exists_linearMap_regularDifferentials_cuspForm_injective` — hence
    `regularDifferentials ℂ K` injects `ℂ`-linearly into `CuspForm (Γ N) 2`.

  The engine is the pin's.  `K` is presented as the fraction field of `ring N`, the
  `ℂ`-subalgebra of `ℍ → ℂ` generated by `jAnalytic` and the Fricke functions; a
  `K`-element is a quotient `a / b` of two `ring N`-elements, hence a meromorphic
  function on `ℍ`, and the Kähler differential `D` is sent to the derivative of that
  quotient.  The two sides of the argument — the `τ`-side germ at `i∞` (`HolDiff`) and the
  cusp side on the `q`-disc (`CuspVanish`) — share the fraction-field helper block, which
  is written once here (`HolDiff`) and used by both; the two headlines after them assemble
  the cusp form (`CuspFormAssembly`).

  The pin's scaffolding (`p2m_export`/`p2m_open`/`p2m_reactivate`, its
  `set_option linter.* false` lines, its `synthInstance.maxHeartbeats` bump and its
  `set_option maxHeartbeats` overrides) is not transcribed.

  FLT provenance, pinned `aa2d8b3`; the three node proofs are
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/aa2d8b3/P2M/Sol/S_ModularCurve_LevelN_exists_linearMap_regularDifferentials_mdifferentiable.lean
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/aa2d8b3/P2M/Sol/S_ModularCurve_LevelN_isZeroAtImInfty_slash_of_mem_regularDifferentials.lean
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/aa2d8b3/P2M/Sol/S_ModularCurve_LevelN_exists_linearMap_regularDifferentials_cuspForm_injective.lean

  Imported, not re-proved: the LevelN preamble (`ring` and its action lemmas, `𝕌`, `up`,
  `analyticOnNhd_up`, `differentiableAt_up`, `slash_two_apply`, `periodic_of_mem`,
  `exists_isBoundedAtImInfty_mul_pow`, `AnalyticPlaces.moeb` and its derivative),
  `Place.exists_of_orderMap`, and `slash_eq_self_of_mem_Gamma_of_mul_eq`.

  spec-pin: Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_LevelN_exists_linearMap_regularDifferentials_mdifferentiable.lean
  spec-pin: P2M/Sol/S_ModularCurve_LevelN_exists_linearMap_regularDifferentials_mdifferentiable.lean   -- comparable copy
  spec-pin: Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_LevelN_isZeroAtImInfty_slash_of_mem_regularDifferentials.lean
  spec-pin: P2M/Sol/S_ModularCurve_LevelN_isZeroAtImInfty_slash_of_mem_regularDifferentials.lean   -- comparable copy
  spec-pin: Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_LevelN_exists_linearMap_regularDifferentials_cuspForm_injective.lean
  spec-pin: P2M/Sol/S_ModularCurve_LevelN_exists_linearMap_regularDifferentials_cuspForm_injective.lean   -- comparable copy
-/
